@startuml
!theme plain
component "02 Beat + Worker" as B
component "Admin / Web / API" as A
component "07 Ingest" as F
cloud "football-data.org / API-Football / Wikidata" as P
database "PostgreSQL football" as D
component "05 KB: SQLite + FAISS + BM25" as K
B --> F : trigger /ingest/run via Redis+Celery
A --> F : manual trigger
F --> P : fetch by scope / flags
F --> D : upsert data + IndexTask
F --> K : /index/upsert
D ..> K : IndexTask retried by 07
note bottom of P : OpenFootball/Fjelstul archive loaded by scripts
@enduml
